<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <% var title = "I beam fitting and removal | MK Damp and Timber LTD" %>
  <%- include('../partials/seo') %>
  <meta name="description" content="I beam fitting and removal for structural openings and beam replacement. Professional, safe and engineered solutions for property transformation." />
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071019;--panel:rgba(16,25,39,0.95);--accent:#f9bf5e;--muted:#9fb0c6;--text:#eef4fb;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#041018,#071019);color:var(--text)}
    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem}
    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:24px;min-height:520px;background:url('https://mkdampandtimber.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/i-beam-fitting.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;display:grid;align-items:flex-end;color:#fff}
    .hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,14,25,0.1),rgba(7,14,25,0.95));}
    .hero-content{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:3rem;max-width:720px;}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.02;}
    .hero p{margin:1rem 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:620px;}
    .hero-actions{margin-top:2rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:.95rem 1.75rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;transition:transform .2s ease}
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#081018}
    .btn-secondary{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);color:#fff}
    .section{margin-top:2.5rem}
    .section-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .section-header h2{margin:0;font-size:2rem}
    .section-header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px}
    .grid{display:grid;gap:1rem}
    .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .panel{background:var(--panel);padding:1.5rem;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}
    .timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem}
    .timeline-card{background:var(--card);padding:1.5rem;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)}
    .timeline-card strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:var(--accent)}
    .features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem}
    .feature{padding:1.25rem;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.04),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}
    .feature strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:var(--accent)}
    .safety{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-top:1rem}
    .safety-card{background:var(--card);padding:1.5rem;border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)}
    .faq{margin-top:1rem}
    .faq-item{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:var(--panel);}
    .faq-item button{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1rem 1.2rem;background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--text);font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer}
    .faq-body{padding:0 1.2rem 1rem;color:var(--muted);display:none;line-height:1.7}
    .cta-banner{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.75rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:1rem;align-items:center;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(249,191,94,0.14), rgba(7,14,23,0.96));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}
    .cta-banner h3{margin:0;font-size:1.6rem}
    .cta-banner p{margin:.65rem 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92)}
    .footer-note{margin-top:2.5rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:.95rem}
    @media(max-width:980px){.grid-2,.timeline,.features,.safety{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{min-height:420px}}
    @media(max-width:640px){.section-header{flex-direction:column;}.cta-banner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-content{padding:2rem;}}
  </style>

</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/navbar', { currentPage: 'i-beam-fitting' }) %>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span style="display:inline-flex;padding:.6rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase">Structural engineering</span>
        <h1>I beam fitting and removal</h1>
        <p>Fitting an I beam in your property can transform your living space; small cramped rooms can be instantly opened up into spaces open plan living spaces. However, I beam fitting and removal is definitely not a DIY job, get it wrong and there can be serious consequences for your property. I beam fitting and removal is a job best left for the experienced professionals.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+441923904441">Call 01923 904441</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact-us">Contact our experts</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Service process timeline</h2>
        <p>From survey through to structural handover, our engineering-led process ensures every I beam installation is safe, compliant and well coordinated.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-card">
          <strong>1. Structural survey</strong>
          <p>We review your property, assess load paths and determine the right beam size and support positions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-card">
          <strong>2. Design & preparation</strong>
          <p>We work with engineers or use proven specifications, prepare openings and support the structure before installation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-card">
          <strong>3. Installation & finish</strong>
          <p>Steelwork is fitted, connections are secured and the opening is finished with neat aesthetic and structural details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Feature cards</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Precision engineering</strong>
          <p>Accurate beam placement and load-bearing calculations to preserve house safety and performance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Open plan transformation</strong>
          <p>Create larger kitchen, dining or living areas with a structural opening that works aesthetically and safely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Full removal service</strong>
          <p>From beam removal to replacement, we manage the full process for a seamless structural upgrade.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section safety">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Safety & compliance</h2>
        <p>Steel beam fitting is a specialist operation. We ensure temporary supports, structural stability and compliance with building regulations at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Why professional installation matters</h2>
        <p>Get it wrong and there can be serious consequences for your property. Our team removes risk by using engineered solutions and experienced contractors.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Safety considerations</h2>
        <p>We follow strict site safety, support installation protocols and coordinate with any required engineering approvals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin:1rem 0 0;padding-left:1.15rem;">
          <li>Temporary propping before removal</li>
          <li>Engineered beam sizing and connections</li>
          <li>Clearance of services and safe demolition</li>
          <li>Quality finish and load distribution</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>FAQ</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)"><span>Do I need an engineer for an I beam?</span><span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-body">Yes, I beam fitting should be designed or checked by a structural engineer to ensure the beam size and support positions are correct.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)"><span>Can you replace load-bearing walls with an I beam?</span><span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-body">We frequently replace load-bearing walls with steel beams, but only after a careful structural assessment and temporary support setup.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)"><span>What happens after installation?</span><span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-body">We complete the finishing around the beam, remove temporary supports and leave the area clean and ready for decoration.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-banner">
      <div>
        <h3>Want structural beam work done properly?</h3>
        <p>Get a quote from our experienced I beam fitting team for safe, engineered property transformations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact-us">Contact us</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+441923904441">Call 01923 904441</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="footer-note">
      <p>MK Damp and Timber LTD have transformed many properties in the Milton Keynes, Watford and London area. If you are looking for a quote to get the job done properly, contact us today either by phone or by using the contact page, and talk to our experts.</p>
      <p>MK Damp and Timber LTD • 01923 904441 • 07808 665460 • Company No. 14163466 • 31 High Street, Winslow, Buckinghamshire, MK18 3HE</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    function toggleFAQ(button){
      const item=button.closest('.faq-item');
      const body=item.querySelector('.faq-body');
      const open=body.style.display==='block';
      body.style.display=open?'none':'block';
      button.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent=open?'+':'-';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>